      "writtenOn": "2025-05-14T20:12:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "At first glance, this looks like a false positive since `cros_flash_npcx_get_status_reg` should be initializing it.\n\nIt would be good to check whether the call to `cros_flash_npcx_get_status_reg` could fail; in that case it would be uninitialized.\n\n@chlin56@nuvoton.com, can you comment?\n\nIt shouldn\u0027t hurt to initialize; it\u0027s in a loop, but correctness is more important than optimization.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 69,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 69,
        "endChar": 18
      },
      "revId": "5182b801c23c590d7a70f997151218a66629a5d6",
