      "writtenOn": "2025-05-15T08:46:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`cros_flash_npcx_get_status_reg ` could fail in some exception cases, ex:\n1. user provide NULL buffer for input or output buffer\n2. the flash controller is locked.\n\nIMO, checking the return value of `cros_flash_npcx_get_status_reg`  and return immediately if the return value is not 0 should be more robust.",
